ownership will leave the contract without an owner, thereby disabling any functionality that is only available to the owner.\"},\"transferOwnership(address)\":{\"details\":\"Transfers ownership of the contract to a new account (`newOwner`). Can only be called by the current owner.\"}},\"title\":\"GasTank\",\"version\":1},\"userdoc\":{\"kind\":\"user\",\"methods\":{\"balanceOf(address)\":{\"notice\":\"User balance in USDC (6 decimals)\"},\"deposit(uint256)\":{\"notice\":\"User deposits USDC into their gas tank (6 decimals).\"},\"depositFor(address,uint256)\":{\"notice\":\"Deposit USDC into the gas tank on behalf of a user. Caller must have approved this contract. Used by vaults to fund user gas in one tx.\"},\"executor()\":{\"notice\":\"Relayer/executor address allowed to call recordExecution\"},\"gasCostPerExecutionUsdc6()\":{\"notice\":\"Gas cost per DCA execution in USDC (6 decimals). Editable by owner. E.g. $0.01 = 10_000.\"},\"recordExecution(address,uint256)\":{\"notice\":\"Executor (backend relayer) records gas cost for a user and gets reimbursed in USDC.\"},\"setGasCostPerExecution(uint256)\":{\"notice\":\"Set gas cost per execution in USDC (6 decimals). E.g. $0.01 = 10_000, $0.005 = 5_000.\"},\"withdraw(uint256)\":{\"notice\":\"User withdraws USDC from their gas tank.\"}},\"notice\":\"Holds user USDC balances used to pay for DCA execution gas. The backend relayer         executes DCA swaps (pays gas) and calls recordExecution to deduct from the user's         tank and reimburse the relayer. Each network has its own GasTank; gas cost per         execution is set per contract (e.g. Base $0.005, BSC $0.01) and is editable by owner.\",\"version\":1}},\"settings\":{\"compilationTarget\":{\"src/GasTank.sol\":\"GasTank\"},\"evmVersion\":\"paris\",\"libraries\":{},\"metadata\":{\"bytecodeHash\":\"ipfs\"},\"optimizer\":{\"enabled\":true,\"runs\":200},\"remappings\":[\":@openzeppelin/=lib/openzeppelin-contracts/\",\":forge-std/=lib/forge-std/src/\",\":openzeppelin-con